> Linkages will include partnerships with NASA scientists focusing on Earth system modeling and climate impacts, as well as collaborations with state agencies to integrate local climate data into our research framework. Moreover, involvement of undergraduate and graduate students in this project will enhance Delaware's higher education landscape, preparing a skilled workforce equipped to tackle global sustainability challenges. Overall, this project will strengthen Delaware’s research infrastructure while contributing to national and global scientific endeavors.
